---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; const faqs=[['Does the app require installation?','No. Releases are portable ZIP archives. Extract the complete archive and run GenshinPiano.exe.'],['Why should I avoid Program Files?','Settings, logs, update caches, and add-ons live beside the app, while Program Files normally blocks standard-user writes.'],['Which score formats are supported?','You can edit .gpiano projects and import MIDI, MusicXML, and legacy .GenshinPiano scores.'],['Does it control the game automatically?','Only after you start playback. Keyboard input is sent only while a supported game window is in the foreground; losing focus pauses playback.'],['Is OCR required?','No. OCR is an optional, separately downloaded add-on.'],['Are update packages verified?','Yes. Packages are checked with SHA-256 and an RSA signature before installation.'],['How do I report a problem?','Keep the relevant files from the logs folder and open an issue on GitHub.']];
---
<BaseLayout locale="en" title="FAQ · GenshinPiano"><section class="page-hero shell"><span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span><h1>Frequently asked questions</h1><p>Installation, formats, safe playback, OCR, and updates.</p></section><section class="section shell faq-list">{faqs.map(([q,a],i)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{q}<span>＋</span></summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}<div class="support-box"><div><h2>Still need help?</h2><p>Include reproduction steps and relevant logs when opening an issue.</p></div><a class="button button-secondary" href="https://github.com/tozyx/GenshinPiano/issues">Open GitHub Issues</a></div></section></BaseLayout>